g exact search context.\\n- BLE: add a bounded session byte stream, a pinned-identity encrypted-echo example and a separate macOS CoreBluetooth helper. Production discovery, node routing and wire formats are unchanged. Shutdown revokes buffered bytes; asynchronous test work is joined; the CLI confirms helper retirement before reporting success. Invalid peripheral batches are rejected atomically. This is experimental: two-host physical radio behavior is not qualified by local compilation or stream tests.\\n- Maintenance: update CI/reliability guides and existing capability owners. Prefer stability and simple orchestration over arbitrary duration targets; keep squash merge as the documented default. Lifecycle fixtures supply observed private scanner dependencies while retaining real process supervision. Cheap pre-publication checks now run configured spelling over changed files (full scan when its configuration changes); the CoreBluetooth SDK spelling has a Swift-only identifier exception.\\n\\nLocal evidence includes the pinned-tool archive/coverage and native-symbol controls, standards/hygiene, workflow checks, 37 installer/workflow regression cases, eight Gitleaks transport/integrity/exit cases and 40 isolated validation CLI cases, the causal linked replay positive and independent no-replay negative, frontend lint/types/build, 2196 frontend tests and verified 16/16 added executable lines (100% against the unchanged 92% patch requirement) for the committed candidate. Focused chat unit tests passed; the reaction-affordance regressions failed before their fixes and then passed 12/12. Browser integration covers attachment/camera/directory races, menus, all visual-regression scenarios without snapshot updates, protection and narrow layouts, seven WebKit attachment cases, and a real-search exact-context inspector regression. The original writable paging/removal case remains intact. A separate ignored-source control that omits the real history replay fails exactly at the offered-erased-record assertion; the current implementation passes. Three real menu-selection unit cases additionally verify exactly-once callback ownership and menu closure.\\n\\nBLE validation passed six stream tests plus the example parser test, Swift typechecking, radio-free batch controls and helper compilation with its privacy plist. Tests on two physical Macs with IP networking disabled, permission changes, Bluetooth interruption and reconnect remain outside these results.\\n\\nThe complete CI run on the current commit remains required before merge, including all 33 required GitHub Actions checks and native platform acceptance. Failed or deliberately superseded attempts remain diagnostic records, not successful performance samples. Before/after measurements separate dispatch, setup, execution and runner cost; no fixed elapsed-time guarantee is claimed.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1b8a7-3fc8-7460-a590-a3bb58793d59","create_time":1794157451.056312}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
